# =========================================================================
# Unity Standard Ignored Folders (Modified for subfolder compatibility)
# =========================================================================
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]serSettings/

# MemoryCaptures and Recordings can get excessive in size
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/

